  "description": "A Few Quick Notes Before The Weekend ✍️",
  "body_html": "<p>Goodmorning and Happy Friday, a few quick thoughts before we depart for the week. </p><h4><strong>Will Israel and Iran War Crash The Stock Market?</strong></h4><p>I give no personal view point on the matter, to be clear. But my honest <em><strong>speculation</strong></em>, is that <strong>the stock market will soon forget and move on</strong>. This entire region of the world has been at war since man walked earth. Even I have served over there years ago. We can see that Iran has been engaged in modern warfare since at least 1979, and well before.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p><p>A short term scare to the market? Sure. Long term? Possible, but I doubt it.</p><p>Regardless…we have several positions up. We will ensure profits are locked with those. Stocks down or within range, we will not allow to turn into big losses.</p><p>As mentioned yesterday, due to the VIX being fussy, have stops set or cut prices in mind.</p><ul><li><p>Does this warrant freak out mode? No.</p></li><li><p>Should we panic sell a -3% move on a mid-cap stock? No.</p></li></ul><p>Does this post guarantee the stock market will recover? No.</p><p><strong>But we will ensure profits don’t turn to bags, and small losses do not become big losses!</strong></p><h4><strong>Please Fill Out The Survey…It Takes LESS THAN 2 MINUTES!</strong></h4><p>We are rapidly approaching a Full Orange Badge, 56 spots remain before I must, unfortunately, increase prices. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a>, which has produced numerous big winners. We must limit access so it does not lose its edge. Details of this can be found in this article, “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/membership-is-growing-fast-and-thats?r=4z8lgl\">Membership is Growing Fast – And That’s Kind of a Problem in the Stock Market</a>.”</p><p>I cannot improve your experience here on Substack, if I don’t know what gripes you have! The quick survey can be accessed by clicking 👉 <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/survey/3438020?token=\">HERE</a> 👈</p><h4><strong>Improvements For Long Term Investors</strong></h4><p>The StockTok screener as mentioned, has produced a lot of winners. But I am fully cognizant that many of you do not like to actively trade (to be totally fair, even I dont like how “quick” it is…but I take what I can get!) </p><p>This weekend, my goal is to build a 2nd screener from the original, but it will operate off the Weekly and Monthly time frame. This will provide longer term trades and investments. Stay tuned for updates on this!</p><p>As always, thank you for your support. I hope that you have found the content beneficial, and a place you feel welcome. If you have questions, never hesitate to ping me in the chat. If I am not there, just tag me, and I will respond when I return. </p><p>HAVE A GREAT WEEKEND AND THANKS FOR STOPPING BY! 👍</p><div><hr></div><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_wars_involving_Iran</p><p></p></div></div>",
